  "body": "Fantastic opportunity to secure a piece of Stanmore Bay zoned Mixed Housing Suburban and ripe for development.\r\n\r\n16b Tower Hill is a 599sqm freehold site and 18c Tower Hill, 357sqm of freehold adjacent land, both with services to the gate. Access is via a ROW off Tower Hill.\r\n\r\nDocuments available:\r\nApproved Engineering Plans, Resource Consent Approval, Scheme plans, Sub-division Engineering Plans, Subdivision Sign-off.\r\n\r\nSituated just minutes from Coast Plaza shopping centre. Zoned for and walking distance to both Whangaparaoa Primary and Whangaparaoa College, Edith Hopper Park and local beaches.",
